    "updated_at": "2021-09-24T10:38:53Z",
    "body": "In https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/6680 I found that a redirect during traversal causes the entry to swap its document state. This prevents iframe reparenting because it's the document state that holds the nested history.\r\n\r\nFeels like the same should happen if the origin changes.",
